#: darkify-react/src/pages/Help.jsx:130
msgid "Darkify – is an extremely advanced dark mode plugin for any WordPress website. The plugin has the option to enable a dark mode switcher for the front end and also WordPress admin."
msgstr "Darkify to wyjątkowo zaawansowana wtyczka trybu ciemnego dla każdej witryny WordPress. Umożliwia włączenie przełącznika trybu ciemnego zarówno w witrynie, jak i w panelu administracyjnym WordPressa."

#: darkify-react/src/pages/Help.jsx:135
msgid "WhatsApp Chat Help - Chat Support Plugin For WordPress"
msgstr "WhatsApp Chat Help - Chat Support Plugin For WordPress"

#: darkify-react/src/pages/Help.jsx:136
msgid "Whatsapp chat support is a WordPress plugin that allows website owners to easily add a WhatsApp chat button to their website."
msgstr "WhatsApp Chat Support to wtyczka WordPress, która pozwala właścicielom witryn łatwo dodać przycisk czatu WhatsApp do swojej strony."

#: darkify-react/src/pages/Help.jsx:141
msgid "Event Carousel, Event Slider, Event Grid, and Event List for The Events Calendar"
msgstr "Event Carousel, Event Slider, Event Grid, and Event List for The Events Calendar"

#: darkify-react/src/pages/Help.jsx:142
msgid "With \"Eventful,\" you can effortlessly create intelligent layouts for \"The Events Calendar\" plugin, effectively addressing and resolving compatibility issues that may arise."
msgstr "Dzięki „Eventful” bez trudu utworzysz przemyślane układy dla wtyczki „The Events Calendar”, skutecznie rozwiązując problemy ze zgodnością, które mogą się pojawić."

#: darkify-react/src/pages/Help.jsx:147
msgid "Domain For Sale"
msgstr "Domain For Sale"

#: darkify-react/src/pages/Help.jsx:148
msgid "The ultimate WordPress plugin for domain sales, appraisals, auctions, and marketplace management."
msgstr "Kompletna wtyczka WordPress do sprzedaży domen, wycen, aukcji i zarządzania marketplace’em."

#: darkify-react/src/pages/Help.jsx:153
msgid "Greet - Video Bubble Plugin for WordPress"
msgstr "Greet - Video Bubble Plugin for WordPress"

#: darkify-react/src/pages/Help.jsx:154
msgid "Placing a video on websites can increase the sales of your services or products in a significant way. Greet is a professional video bubble plugin for showing a welcome video on your websites in a great and fun way."
msgstr "Umieszczenie wideo w witrynie potrafi znacząco zwiększyć sprzedaż usług lub produktów. Greet to profesjonalna wtyczka wideo, która w atrakcyjny i przyjemny sposób wyświetla powitalny film na Twoich stronach."

#: darkify-react/src/pages/Help.jsx:159
msgid "Eventful for Elementor - Events Showcase for The \"The Events Calendar\""
msgstr "Eventful for Elementor - Events Showcase for The \"The Events Calendar\""

#: darkify-react/src/pages/Help.jsx:160
msgid "Easily display events from The Events Calendar plugin with Elementor widgets, offering seamless customization and powerful layout options."
msgstr "Łatwo prezentuj wydarzenia z wtyczki The Events Calendar za pomocą widżetów Elementora, z płynną personalizacją i rozbudowanymi opcjami układu."

#: darkify-react/src/pages/Help.jsx:169
msgid "Fantastic plugin which creates a very pleasing balance of shades in dark mode, which is very important for me as some of my students are dyslexic and visual clarity is essential! Easy to install and setup, but I had two things I couldn’t figure…a check box, and targeting content in an iframe (h5p). I created a short video for support and they solved it within 90 minutes. I found a second problem, which they solved in less than an hour! When I say ‘solved it’ I mean I gave them access and they went in and did the work! Incredible! If you need Dark Mode, look no further!"
msgstr ""

#: darkify-react/src/pages/Help.jsx:174
msgid "I’ve tried several dark mode plugins over the past few years, including WP Dark Mode, Darklup, Dracula Dark Mode, DarkMySite, Darklooks, Dusky Dark Mode, Dark Mode Toggle, Dark Reader and a few lightweight CSS-only solutions. Many of them looked promising at first, but they always seemed to come with some trade-offs either too heavy, too many ads in the admin panel, compatibility issues with Elementor or limited custom control. After switching to Darkify Dark Mode it’s the first time I’ve actually stuck with a dark mode plugin and didn’t feel the need to look for alternatives."
msgstr ""

#: darkify-react/src/pages/Help.jsx:179
msgid "Truly never dealt with better support than this. I was sceptical at first to spend money on this plugin, but after having dealt with a couple issues, and support getting to replying to my support tickets in less than 1 hour, I am no longer disappointed for having to spend money on this plugin. (I am not one to spend money on plugins often. Very rare!) So definitely had to leave a 5 star review if not for support alone; the plugin itself is absolutely perfect! Does exactly what I want, and then some! 🙂 Couldn’t be happier with the results. Thank you!"
msgstr ""

